n rewrite or polish them in your own voice.\n- Coding help: generate and explain code, including SwiftUI, with step-by-step guidance.\n- Learning and homework: practice languages through interactive stories and work through school problems one step at a time.\n- Smart summaries: condense long articles, videos, and documents into the key points in seconds.\n\nUSE CASES:\n\n- Text generation: write, rewrite, summarize, and translate everything from emails to essays.\n- Image generation: create original images and artwork from a simple description.\n- Image transformation: restyle and edit your own photos into new styles.\n- Image search: identify objects, places, and landmarks straight from a photo.\n- Web research: get current answers on any topic with sources you can verify.\n- Document analysis: upload files and links to get instant summaries and answers.\n- Voice conversation: talk to AI hands-free and get spoken replies.\n- Coding and learning: generate code, study new languages, and get step-by-step homework help.\n\nBENEFITS:\n\n- One app for every leading AI model, so you stop juggling separate tools.\n- Answers, images, and finished writing in seconds instead of hours.\n- Web results backed by real, checkable sources.\n- A single, simple home for everything from quick questions to creative projects.\n\nDownload Chat AI and start exploring everything one app full of AI can do.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://static.askaichat.app/privacy-en.html\nTerms of Use: https://static.askaichat.app/terms-conditions-en.html","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.67675,"sellerUrl":"https://www.codeway.co/","languageCodesISO2A":["AR","EN","FR","DE","ID","IT","JA","KO","PT","RO","RU","ZH","ES","TR","VI"],"fileSizeBytes":"202061824","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2181,"trackContentRating":"12+","bundleId":"com.codeway.chatapp","price":0.0,"releaseNotes":"We fixed some pesky bugs and improved the overall performance of the app.","trackId":1668787639,"tr